{"id":"H8006","lemma":"שִׁלֵּם","transliteration":"shillem","sayIt":"shil-lem","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Shillem","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Naphtali living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Gen.46.24;\nson of: Naphtali (H5321);\nbrother of: Jahzeel (H3183), Guni (H1476) and Jezer (H3337); also called Shallum at 1Ch.7.13; Shillemite at Num.26.49;\n§ Shillem = \"repaid\"\nson of Naphtali","glosses":["shillem"],"count":2,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"gen-46","v":24,"renderings":{"bsb":"and Shillem"}},{"chapterId":"num-26","v":49,"renderings":{"bsb":"from Shillem","kjv":"of Shillem"}}],"elsewhere":[{"ref":"Genesis 46:24","note":"The sons of Naphtali: Jahzeel, Guni, Jezer, and Shillem.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Numbers 26:49","note":"of Jezer, the family of the Jezerites; of Shillem, the family of the Shillemites.","source":"web"}],"related":[{"id":"H1476","lemma":"גּוּנִי","transliteration":"guni","gloss":"Guni"},{"id":"H3183","lemma":"יַחְצְאֵל","transliteration":"yachtseel","gloss":"Jahzeel"},{"id":"H3337","lemma":"יֵ֫צֶר","transliteration":"yetser","gloss":"Jezer"},{"id":"H5321","lemma":"נַפְתָּלִי","transliteration":"naphtali","gloss":"Naphtali"},{"id":"H7967","lemma":"שַׁלּוּם","transliteration":"shallum","gloss":"Shallum"},{"id":"H8016","lemma":"שִׁלֵּמִי","transliteration":"shillemi","gloss":"Shillemite"},{"id":"H1477","lemma":"גּוּנִי","transliteration":"guni","gloss":"Gunite"},{"id":"H3184","lemma":"יַחְצְאֵלִי","transliteration":"yachtseeli","gloss":"Jahzeelite"}],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}